This codebase began from studying the original cheat-engine/UnrealEngineTools
repository (https://github.com/cheat-engine/UnrealEngineTools) by Dark Byte,
which provided two separate Lua scripts written for Cheat Engine 7.7 using
APIs not available in CE 7.5. CE75.LUA is a complete rewrite — combined,
ported to CE 7.5 APIs, refactored for reload-safety, and extended with
game-specific plugin support. Portions of the concept and structure are
derived from that original work.

